    "name": "madie-java-models",
    "description": "Java models for any Java project associated with MADiE",
    "longDescription": "madie-java-models is a Java library that provides shared data models for the MADiE (Measure Authoring Development Integrated Environment) ecosystem. This library serves as a foundational component used across multiple MADiE microservices, ensuring consistency in data structures and model definitions. The models are published as Maven artifacts and can be easily integrated into Java-based projects. The library follows semantic versioning and supports snapshot publishing for development purposes through pull requests against the develop branch.",
